# 6. QREF CANONICAL

Explicit QREF lexical candidates = **2,704**.

Primary explicit QREF anchors = **2,702**.

Perbedaan dua occurrence berasal dari exact interrogative form:

```text
آلله

```

Policy canonical:

```text
QRefPolicy::canonical_explicit_divine_reference()

```

memasukkan recurrence form tetapi:

```text
excluded_primary_exact_skeletons = ["آلله"]

```

Jadi:

```text
lexical candidates = 2704
primary anchors    = 2702

```

Ini BUKAN kontradiksi.

Jangan menulis kembali “canonical explicit QREF = 2704” tanpa menjelaskan perbedaan lexical candidate vs primary anchor.

Primary explicit QREF family sebelumnya:

```text
الله      2153
والله      240
بالله      139
لله         116
ولله         27
تالله         8
فالله         6
فلله          6
اللهم          5
أبالله         1
وتالله         1
----------------
PRIMARY     2702

```

