# 8. QRELATION LOCUS

Old implementation Cosmic memiliki semantic enum seperti:

```text
LOVES
COMMANDS
FORGIVES
GUIDES
KNOWS
JUDGES

```

dan hardcoded predicate mapping.

Itu legacy/bootstrap saja.

**JANGAN gunakan semantic enum tersebut sebagai discovery input pada PRDE vNext.**

Current neutral object:

```text
QRELATION_LOCUS

```

Relation locus bisa:

```text
DIRECT
MEDIATED

```

Contoh:

```text
الله → يعلم → ...

```

DIRECT.

```text
الله → لا → يهدي → القوم

```

Relation locus:

```text
يهدي

```

Bukan seluruh path.

